=== Text #1 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]The sign has arrived and I couldn’t be more thrilled! It’s PERFECT!!! Thanks a million!

=== Text #2 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]J Brand can do no wrong! They always have such beautiful pieces that belong in every women closet. I just wished my wallet agreed with me 😋 Lol!

=== Text #3 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Tech enthusiast. Graphic designer. Aspiring polymath. Operator of a sparkling mind.
12: Straight-Up "Silence of the Lambs"

=== Text #4 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Pensive CD - Deirdre Faith - Wishlist.
I love the band Pensive...this is their merch buying center. I like their CD's though.

=== Text #5 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Very Cold and windy today.
that windswept English country. Makes you feel so alive.
Boy I needed to be alive it was very tricky. Hail storms etc!!

=== Text #6 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Please choose a security question What is your birth place? What is your pet's name? What is your mother's middle name? What kind of person are you?

=== Text #7 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Coming to a show and need a little help finding your way?
Here’s the information you’ll need. We look forward to your visit, and enjoy the show.

=== Text #8 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Hey Buddy!, I found this information for you: "Afspraak maken". Here is the website link: https://hypnose4all.nl/afspraak-maken/. Thank you.

=== Text #9 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]It is a beautiful home. A rose blooms in my garden now.
Thank you! I thought so, my Dad cooks with it.
Do you cook the curry for how many people?

=== Text #10 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]well it was big fat electric, for sure. Very techno, mathematical sounding. Sort of maddening but I like it. I could see it as one of those Chariot of Fire style film backings.

=== Text #11 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]A fairly cold last half of January meant that I went through quite a bit of wood. Just to be safe, I had some replenishment delivered. I wonder will this satisfy the valentine desires for warmth and ambiance ?

=== Text #12 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Ok, now. Ohhh... There's whole new world to discover... Thank you VERY much!
Comments later, I've got a few ideas but I feel too tired to make halfway good comments.

=== Text #13 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]I'm the type of woman who will drive you crazy . There is no force equal to a woman determined to rise. I'm not afraid to take control and you might love it. Role-playing is one of my favorite fantasies.

=== Text #14 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]By The Abyssinian | On May 13, 2015 | in Fun with Comments Off on Ethiopian food on The Simpsons!
Eat my Shiro! Check out the clip from The Simpsons! (23×5).

=== Text #15 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]I thought I was going to finish the 3rd season of the Wire tonight.
But there was a commentary on episode 11, so I had to re-watch Middle Ground with the commentary. Hopefully I can finish the season next weekend.

=== Text #16 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]> god-mode in the new buffer.
`setq-default' to set a default for all other buffers.
better approach.  This is a per-buffer feature.
easy way to run code automatically when it is toggled.

=== Text #17 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Check out these two awesome ladies!!
They competed all weekend at the Heart of America CrossFit Competition. Three days of workouts and fun. They did GREAT!!! Very cool to see them compete. More to come on this, once I’ve rested a little.

=== Text #18 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Robyn Hood Black makes poems and art in the balmy South Carolina Lowcountry of the US. Her haiku appear in several journals and anthologies. A children’s book author, her published works include fiction, nonfiction, and many poems in anthologies and magazines.

=== Text #19 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]October is breast cancer awareness month. What can you do to keep from needing to wear the pink ribbon? Dr. Patrick and Ross talk about changing your thinking from being treated at the bottom of the cliff or stopping before you fall off. You’ll have to watch to get it.

=== Text #20 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]We build our students up only to encourage them to flee. Why?
Combining advertising campaigns handled by pros along with play on the editorial side of reputable media outlets gets a business noticed by potential customers who won’t be concerned about the veracity of claims.
A sad week in the world of journalism.


