=== Text #9 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]The Loudmouth Jeans. These mid rise, loose fit, dusty black jeans are a perfectly casual go-to. Features include all over distressing and an unfinished, frayed hem.

=== Text #10 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]All prints come in both sizes, on cream card, 350 gsm. Off sizes available on request.
All rights of images and content belong to Salty Philip.

=== Text #11 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]SCU Middletown makes it easy for you to get a quote online. Find the quote you're interested in, and click the link to get started. It's that easy!

=== Text #12 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]The fruit coasters are ornament and very colorful. They are great for cocktail parties.
Dimensions: 4.25" x 3.8" x 3.65"

=== Text #13 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Create a solid foundation for your outfit with the Building Blocks Oval Gold Earrings! A texture gold metal oval shape. Earrings measure 1.5" long.
Long Hoop at the back.

=== Text #14 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Come test your luck on the best slot machine app in the app store. Great graphics make this app so fun to play.
Test your luck with Pharaoh Slots! Bet, Spin and Get Lucky!

=== Text #15 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Foil plaid lycra and spandex shortall with metallic slinky insets. Attached metallic elastic belt with O-ring. Headband included. Great hip hop or jazz dance costume. Made in the USA.

=== Text #16 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]OpenWRT that use -Os to make small binaries.
OS X.  I don't know enough about the other platforms to say.
Here's the Debian docs on the topic.

=== Text #17 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Need to make a doctor appointment for Tetralogy of Fallot (TOF) this week? Use Zocdoc to find doctors near you who take your insurance. It’s simple, secure and free.

=== Text #18 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Dig and Rig Equipment Dedicated to the HDD industry and those within it. Consulting, service, tooling, and MTI Equipment. We offer a full line of underground tooling and replacement parts for directional drills and trenchers.

=== Text #19 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Pads allow you to transition nicely from floor to pole. Slide on the floor, dragging your knees without sticking to the floor. They cover just enough of your knee to protect it without preventing you from gripping the pole.

=== Text #20 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Whether on the beach or on a court. Volleyball trophies recognize your team members and celebrates that victorious win.
An Elegant Diamond Volleyball Sport Award that can be a Desk Accessory, Mounted on a Plaque or on a Wall.


